# SwiftFormat configuration (nicklockwood/SwiftFormat).
# Kept deliberately close to defaults: the value is consistency, not cleverness.
--swiftversion 5.10
--maxwidth 120
--indent 4
# SwiftLint's opening_brace demands same-line braces; this rule demands the
# opposite after multiline conditions. One must yield — SwiftLint wins.
--disable wrapMultilineStatementBraces
--exclude Packages/MunchKit/.build
